* This dofile is for retention calculation in Stata
* The data is simulated, with 50 individuals within 39 households.

* 1. Check the data format to make sure it is date format. // 检查日期格式
gen date = date(string(date_str), "YMD")  // 若你的日期是字符串
format date %td  // 若本身就是日期格式则忽略

* 2. Determine whether the user satisfies the retention condition. // 判断是否次日留存
gen next_day = date + 1  // Generate the date of the next day after being observed. // 生成观测日期的次日
gen retained = 0  // Generate the retention marker with the initial value of 0. // 生成留存标记，默认值为0
sort pid date
bysort pid (date): gen next_active = date[_n+1]  // Get the next observed date for each user. // 为每个用户提取下一条记录的日期（不一定是次日）

replace retained = 1 if next_active == next_day  // Mark as 'retained' if user is active again on the next day. // 若用户次日仍活跃，则记为留存

* 3. Summarise whether each individual is marked as retained at least once. // 计算每个用户是否"至少一次被留存"
egen any_retained = max(retained), by(pid)  // Retained at least once if any daily retained = 1 // 若某天有留存，则该用户被标记为留存过

* 4. Calculate the average retention rate across users. // 计算平均留存率（所有用户中，被留存用户的比例）
mean any_retained


