**2. Determine whether the household satisfies the retention condition. // 判断是否次日留存

preserve  // Temporarily save the original data. //临时保存原始数据，以下逻辑基于家庭-日期维度处理
keep hh_id date
duplicates drop  // Ensure each household has only one record per day. // 保证每个家庭每天只算一次
sort hh_id date

gen next_day = date + 1  // Generate the next calendar day. // 生成次日
gen retained_hh = 0  // Initialize retention flag. // 初始化留存标记
gen next_active_hh = date[_n+1] if hh_id == hh_id[_n+1]  // Get the next activity date within the same household. // 获取下一个属于该家庭的活动日期
replace retained_hh = 1 if next_active_hh == next_day  // Mark retained if activity occurs again the next day. // 若次日仍有记录则记为留存

* 3. Summarise whether each household is retained at least once. // 计算每个家庭是否"至少一次被留存"
egen any_retained_hh = max(retained_hh), by(hh_id)  // Flag households with at least one retained instance. // 只要有一次留存即视为该家庭被留存

* 4. Calculate the average retention rate across households. // 计算平均留存率（被留存家庭在所有家庭中的比例）
mean any_retained_hh

